# instructor/: each week's complete class sheet and teacher note are tracked
# (7 October 2026; the class sheet is released to students the week after its
# class). Everything else in an instructor/ folder stays off GitHub: the item
# bank (items.yaml), results.md, board scripts, renders.
**/instructor/*
!**/instructor/class_complete.qmd
!**/instructor/teacher_note.qmd

# Local build output: teacher renders before they are copied to docs/, and the
# course-level registry of results and items.
_instructor_rendered/
_registry/

# Build state. docs/ is committed: it is the site. _freeze/ is committed too,
# so a site render re-executes only the pages whose source changed.
.quarto/
/.Rproj.user/
.DS_Store

/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# Render leftovers beside sources.
weeks/**/*_cache/
weeks/**/*_files/
